{"$schema":"https://json.schemastore.org/sarif-2.1.0.json","runs":[{"artifacts":[{"contents":{"text":"<scxml xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2005/07/scxml\" version=\"1.0\" initial=\"idle\">\n  <state id=\"idle\">\n    <transition event=\"start\" target=\"running\"/>\n    <transition event=\"start\" target=\"failed\"/>\n    <transition event=\"error\" target=\"failed\"/>\n  </state>\n  <state id=\"running\">\n    <transition target=\"done\"/>\n    <transition target=\"running\"/>\n  </state>\n  <final id=\"failed\"/>\n  <final id=\"done\"/>\n</scxml>\n"},"location":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml034-same-events-no-reorder.scxml"},"mimeType":"application/scxml+xml"}],"columnKind":"utf16CodeUnits","properties":{"diagnosticCounts":{"errors":0,"notes":0,"total":2,"warnings":2},"producer":{"kind":"validator"}},"results":[{"fixes":[{"artifactChanges":[{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml034-same-events-no-reorder.scxml"},"replacements":[{"deletedRegion":{"byteLength":48,"byteOffset":145,"endColumn":48,"endLine":4,"startColumn":49,"startLine":3},"insertedContent":{"text":""}}]}],"description":{"text":"remove the unreachable transition"},"properties":{"applicability":"maybe-incorrect"}}],"level":"warning","locations":[{"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml034-same-events-no-reorder.scxml"},"region":{"endColumn":29,"endLine":4,"startColumn":24,"startLine":4}}}],"message":{"markdown":"transition on `start` in `idle` can never be selected\n\n**Note:** within one state the interpreter selects the first enabled transition in document order; every event it matches is matched first by an earlier unconditional transition\n\n**Help:** both transitions match the same events, so reordering would only shadow the other one: add a `cond` to the one that should be taken only sometimes, or remove this one\n\n**Spec:** SCXML 1.0 §3.13 Selecting and Executing Transitions","text":"transition on `start` in `idle` can never be selected"},"properties":{"byteSpan":{"end":174,"start":169},"category":"lint"},"relatedLocations":[{"id":1,"message":{"text":"this earlier transition has no `cond` and always matches first"},"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml034-same-events-no-reorder.scxml"},"region":{"endColumn":16,"endLine":3,"startColumn":6,"startLine":3}}}],"ruleId":"SCXML034"},{"fixes":[{"artifactChanges":[{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml034-same-events-no-reorder.scxml"},"replacements":[{"deletedRegion":{"byteLength":35,"byteOffset":307,"endColumn":35,"endLine":9,"startColumn":32,"startLine":8},"insertedContent":{"text":""}}]}],"description":{"text":"remove the unreachable transition"},"properties":{"applicability":"maybe-incorrect"}}],"level":"warning","locations":[{"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml034-same-events-no-reorder.scxml"},"region":{"endColumn":16,"endLine":9,"startColumn":6,"startLine":9}}}],"message":{"markdown":"eventless transition in `running` can never be selected\n\n**Note:** within one state the interpreter selects the first enabled transition in document order; an earlier eventless transition without `cond` is always enabled\n\n**Help:** both transitions match the same events, so reordering would only shadow the other one: add a `cond` to the one that should be taken only sometimes, or remove this one\n\n**Spec:** SCXML 1.0 §3.13 Selecting and Executing Transitions","text":"eventless transition in `running` can never be selected"},"properties":{"byteSpan":{"end":323,"start":313},"category":"lint"},"relatedLocations":[{"id":1,"message":{"text":"this earlier transition has no `cond` and always matches first"},"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml034-same-events-no-reorder.scxml"},"region":{"endColumn":16,"endLine":8,"startColumn":6,"startLine":8}}}],"ruleId":"SCXML034"}],"tool":{"driver":{"informationUri":"https://www.w3.org/TR/scxml/","name":"scxml-validator","rules":[{"defaultConfiguration":{"level":"warning"},"fullDescription":{"text":"within one state the interpreter selects the first enabled transition in document order; an earlier transition without `cond` whose descriptors match every event of a later one (or an earlier eventless one) always wins, so the later transition is dead"},"help":{"text":"How to fix: move the specific transition above the general one, add a `cond` to the earlier transition, or remove the dead one.\n\nSpecification: SCXML 1.0 §3.13 Selecting and Executing Transitions\n\nRun `scxml-cli --explain SCXML034` for examples."},"helpUri":"https://www.w3.org/TR/scxml/#SelectingTransitions","id":"SCXML034","name":"SCXML034","properties":{"category":"lint"},"shortDescription":{"text":"a transition is shadowed by an earlier unconditional transition in the same state"}}],"semanticVersion":"0.2.0"}}}],"version":"2.1.0"}